  {
    "id": 3913323760,
    "type": null,
    "body": "Fixed on branch `4-artificer-device-add-rejects-3rd-and-4th-circle-spells`, MR !5. All 26 items are addressed, including the reported `device add` bug.\n\nDesign decisions (items the report left open):\n\n- `device add` charges the same per-circle slot budget as `device create`.\n- Item 10: Construct Stone Golem moves to artificer 15 and Construct Iron Golem to 20.\n- Item 11: Brilliance and Blunder is a gnome racial next to Gnomish Tinkering. Existing gnomes get it only on respec.\n- Item 15: the per-device cooldown had no writer, so its readers were removed rather than inventing a cooldown.\n- Item 23: Artificer Item Creation lets an artificer brew any wizard or cleric spell it could put in a device. The brew's alchemy check is the emulation roll.\n\nHelp is updated in the dev help DB and `help.hlp`. Production help is not synced yet.",
    "author": {
      "id": 42759441,
      "username": "max757",
      "public_email": "",
      "name": "Max aka Mosheh",
      "state": "active",
      "locked": false,
      "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3c7c169343bd7d0f4575137ce8065aee7cb44024d447bbfe66d773133a81c43e?s=80&d=identicon",
      "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/max757"
    },
    "created_at": "2026-09-27T21:12:28.264Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-09-27T21:12:28.264Z",
    "system": false,
    "noteable_id": 204599592,
