  {
    "id": 3913959813,
    "type": null,
    "body": "Fixed by !5, merged as 962463fa6. It covers the reported `device add` circle bug, the other 25 listed defects, and three review fixes to Artificer Item Creation brewing.\n\nFollow-up: production help has not been synced yet (the new `class-artificer` entry and the revised `devices`/`gnomes` entries), and existing gnomes get Brilliance and Blunder only on respec.",
